; sift.mongo's query-DSL ppx rules — [%q] [%fields] [%sort] [%set] [%index]. A plain rules library
; (NOT a ppx_rewriter) that ships with sift.mongo, opt-in. Any driver links {!Sift_mongo_ppx_rules.rules}
; into its single ppx pass: fennec's fur.ppx, the standalone sift.mongo.ppx, or a downstream user's.
; Generates sift.mongo (Filter/Proj/Sort/M/Index) + Bson references, resolved at the consumer.
(library
 (name sift_mongo_ppx_rules)
 (public_name fennec.pulse.sift.mongo.ppx.rules)
 (libraries ppxlib)
 (preprocess
  (pps ppxlib.metaquot)))
